{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）中午11時49分，西貢康定路一個貨倉的職員報案，指其同事遭一綑約重300公斤的紙卷砸傷。警方及救護車接報到場，發現一名男子腳部受傷，他清醒被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。據報，傷者搬貨期間遭該綑紙卷壓傷腳。</p><figure><img alt=\"一綑紙卷倒在地上。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197188225634930688419072.jpeg/O7I0S6nQSbAMRQQS3qm7NmgRQUftlgFteE8sbXhPLG0\"/><figcaption>一綑紙卷倒在地上。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報，傷者搬貨期間遭一綑約300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180220113948672214795.jpeg/jhTA1z8tDcfaUF_XjD_efQI69hMZT8spxRqmSe8apkk\"/><figcaption>據報，傷者搬貨期間遭一綑約300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報，傷者搬貨期間遭一綑約300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180217475600384965038.jpeg/_FY4orPDV9ARRgv5vz5Xpb2GLz6dHmqKFdFeqD_RXqg\"/><figcaption>據報，傷者搬貨期間遭一綑約300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180214602371072847125.jpeg/8RZlhhQmzB9MBM_TcYvFHIo2EA4DGaWm1XnS6P950ug\"/><figcaption>警方封鎖現場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180307816583168643920.jpeg/gK8Rv0lom3NVGW9SOxVv3pN5WUkuyKB8LMsBHwbLAR8\"/><figcaption>警方封鎖現場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180310694006784906124.jpeg/pKs-jL8tG9ZYkDcHgpWIvYqAZN8bMePvwfV6eev1enk\"/><figcaption>（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一個貨倉。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180319552507904621839.jpeg/jFZLvo2QibQ2BYFdiSdRfOojfC-JsVxZe-FwAFHhcAA\"/><figcaption>現場是一個貨倉。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據了解，該名男工早前在搬貨期間遭到一卷300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197180322878722048315790.jpeg/bPsR5EDhdzslYU2ef1JlXEvYrlMA5PLMRxQfn20UH58\"/><figcaption>據了解，該名男工早前在搬貨期間遭到一卷300公斤重的紙卷壓傷腳。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.492791+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:51:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:26.248746+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:59.941755+00:00","content_hash":"7edf4f278a0a37ac8560173bdff25045e370e97ea159db22c056a8a0c5eba329","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}